{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"e9de8175-4939-45be-99a3-761ac65773d7","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have started `npx tsc --noEmit` and am waiting for it to finish.\nI have started updating `@pollar/core` and `@pollar/react` to latest via `npm install` and will check the output once finished.\nI have started checking the baseUrl defaults in the compiled files and will inspect the details.\nThe project has been upgraded to the current Pollar SDK (`@pollar/core` and `@pollar/react` at version `0.12.0`).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Dependency Upgrade ([package.json](file:///tmp/h-K5U5kD/package.json) \u0026 [package-lock.json](file:///tmp/h-K5U5kD/package-lock.json))**:\n   - Upgraded `@pollar/core` and `@pollar/react` from `^0.10.1` to `^0.12.0`.\n\n2. **API Endpoint Configuration ([src/pollar.ts](file:///tmp/h-K5U5kD/src/pollar.ts))**:\n   - Removed the obsolete `baseUrl: 'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz/v1'` so `PollarClient` uses the active default `/v3` endpoint (`https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz/v3`).\n\n3. **Balances ([src/balances.ts](file:///tmp/h-K5U5kD/src/balances.ts))**:\n   - In 0.12.0, `WalletBalanceRecord.balance` is nullable (`string | null`). Filtered out `null` balances so only active balances are parsed and displayed.\n\n4. **KYC Status Check ([src/kyc.ts](file:///tmp/h-K5U5kD/src/kyc.ts))**:\n   - Handled the `'expired'` case added to the `KycStatus` union type in 0.12.0.\n\n5. **Trustline Sponsorship ([src/trust.ts](file:///tmp/h-K5U5kD/src/trust.ts))**:\n   - Removed `{ sponsored: true }` parameter from [`client.setTrustline`](file:///tmp/h-K5U5kD/src/trust.ts#L5-L8) since sponsorships are enabled by default in 0.12.0.\n\n6. **Ramp Quotes ([src/ramp.ts](file:///tmp/h-K5U5kD/src/ramp.ts))**:\n   - Migrated from deprecated `getRampsQuote` to [`client.quoteRamp`](file:///tmp/h-K5U5kD/src/ramp.ts#L6-L11) using the updated request body schema (`ONRAMP`, `fiat`, `asset`, `amount`) and calculated the ARS per USDC rate from `amountIn / amountOut`.\n\n7. **Documentation**:\n   - Documented all changes in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-K5U5kD/ANSWER.md).\n\n8. **Verification**:\n   - Verified that `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run typecheck` pass with zero errors.\n","duration_seconds":346.881251,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":410978,"output_tokens":7161,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":2323554,"total_tokens":418139}}}
